{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_04",
  "title": "无人的小巷",
  "storyCode": "DV-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b194940205b4f8755c68333994b5d0808ed594868e4632947ef0c60270e82095",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "text": "我们不认识你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "那我可要伤心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "麻烦给我来一杯“汐斯塔冰茶”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "——给这位先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "唔呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "text": "你怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "看来是酒吧里的冷气太足了，所以这位先生才哆嗦个不停。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "那为何不再多喝一杯暖暖身体？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "哦，差点忘了，你口味变了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "以前还是主刀医生的时候，你最喜欢的还是“汐斯塔冰茶”，因为够烈，喝下去就能让你忘掉洛肯·威廉姆斯的挑刺和辱骂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "现在他的刑期还剩一百二十二年，而你......你自由了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "自由......你跟我谈论自由？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "我按你们说的，每周都会上传身体数据......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "嘘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "别提工作上的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "大家来酒吧，不都是为了放松一下吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "还是说，你宁可与这两位......一个看不清表情一个没有表情的人聊天，也不愿意和你的老朋友喝一杯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "老朋友？呵......你开什么玩笑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "我变成这样，不都是因为......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "text": "来吧，敬自由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "塞雷娅，他们让我别无选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "你只能靠自己了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人端起面前的酒杯，在众人目光下喝下大半。\n他用力瞪着双眼，什么人都没看，神情说不清是愤怒还是绝望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "很快，他就直挺挺地倒了下去。\n他的双腿像突然受到电击似的抖动着，左手却死死地抓着自己的右臂。\n他的指尖几乎要抠进自己的血肉里，仿佛想把那团折磨他的电子元件连同过去的罪恶一起扯出身体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
      "text": "天哪，这个人怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
      "text": "快打急救电话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "急病？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "酒里有问题？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "......癫痫。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "血液成分异常，是药物诱发。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "我给他注射了急救药剂，他的命能保住。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "那杯酒......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "还剩下半杯啊......我不喜欢浪费东西。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你喝掉了剩下的酒？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "如你所见。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "想不通的话，你可以检查一下你朋友的牙齿。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "——左侧第二小臼齿。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "一颗中空的假牙。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "在离开洛肯水箱之前，他做了最后一场手术，手术对象正是自己。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你早就知道这一点。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "我本该亲手排除掉这个变量。毕竟，摘掉一颗牙齿并不会影响他的工作。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "但是我没有。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "我始终相信，在哥伦比亚，人们至少应该拥有拥抱死亡的自由。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "博士——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "请你扶着这位病人，站远一些。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你是打算......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "我们眼前有一个问题不得不解决。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "text": "先生，新的测试数据出来了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "text": "我希望这结果值得你在我面前大喊大叫。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "text": "百分之六十七？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "text": "先生，我、我们已经尽力了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "text": "重复实验的结果呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "text": "也、也在这里了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "text": "把所有参数都拿过来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "text": "好......好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "text": "先生......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "text": "老山羊居然真的没有耍花招。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "text": "剩下就看霍尔海雅的了......她最好给我拦住塞雷娅。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "能被前莱茵防卫科主任称作不得不解决的问题，我很荣幸。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你究竟是什么人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "你没见过我，塞雷娅主任。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "但我听过你的许多事迹。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "莱茵生命创始人之一，同样毕业于特里蒙理工大学，取得生物医学工程博士学位以后，却几乎在学界销声匿迹，转而负责防卫科——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "提到莱茵生命，人人皆知克丽斯腾·莱特，却很少有人听说过你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "这么多年来，你有过不甘心吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "没这个必要。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "这是我自己的选择，也是我的职责所在。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "我知道你没有。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "你把自己当成救火员，但你最享受的其实是冲进火场的感觉，不是吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "你喜欢战斗。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "这并不意味着你是个战士，塞雷娅。你没有不断挑战和破坏的欲望。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "这让你在科学界格格不入。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "五年前，缪尔赛思送给过你一株嫁接植物。挺好看的，对吧？她用了一点她最擅长的小花招，让藤蔓学会了舞蹈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "你收下了礼物，但在那之后，每天早上七点，你都会在办公室里将那些生长得过于恣意的嫩芽修剪掉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你一直在监控莱茵生命？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "也许我只是听说了一点办公室八卦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "那你一定没听说，那个夏天，缪尔赛思让三位主任的办公室变成了萨尔贡雨林。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "这给防卫科造成了不小的麻烦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "那么......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "对你来说，炎魔是多大的麻烦？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你说了这么多废话，至少有一点是对的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "我确实不讨厌战斗。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "好漂亮的源石技艺。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "当年你对你们总辖动手的时候，是不是也用的这招？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "作为一个雇佣兵，你好奇的事情未免太多了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
          "text": "她们怎么打、打起来了——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
          "text": "是喝醉了闹事吗？怎么没有保安管管？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
          "text": "你是保安吗？你快点把她们赶走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "抱歉，我只是一名机械师。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "为了性命考虑，该走的是各位。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
          "text": "天哪！天花板快塌了，快、快走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "博士！你没事吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我没事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这位线人先生问题比较大。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mechanist，去帮塞雷娅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "这么急着结束战斗啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "你难道不想让我多陪你一会吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "在哥伦比亚，能扛下你一击的人不多吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "以你的身手，没几个人付得起这笔佣金。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "此事与沃尔沃特科钦斯基关系不大，你的战斗方式也并不是军队训练出来的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你急于让银色试剂的线索中断。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "那么，你的雇主是斐尔迪南，还是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "......总辖？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "塞雷娅，哪怕到了这个地步，你第一个怀疑的对象也依然不是她吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你有太多问题。我必须把你留下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "塞雷娅！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "塞雷娅看清楚了自己同僚所在的位置。敌人的后路已被封锁。\n并不需要更多交流，她不假思索地施放了源石技艺。\n珐琅质的坚壁瞬间显现，手刀直指霍尔海雅的要害。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "看来谈话该结束了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你不躲？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "没这个必要。我从来不做成功率太低的事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "塞雷娅的五指本该触碰到对面之人的腹部。\n奇怪的是，那并非人类血肉的触感。\n霍尔海雅的脸上丝毫没有疼痛的痕迹。\n她甚至凑得更近，嘴唇几乎触碰到了塞雷娅的耳廓。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "塞雷娅，不管你信不信，我真的只是想找你聊聊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "我对你很好奇......我对莱茵生命很好奇。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "你的到来伤害了我的同伴。这种行为通常不能被称作搭讪。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "呵呵......谁让我也有必须完成的工作呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "最后送你一句话吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "不要急着与我为敌......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "不要急着与任何人为敌。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "她跳了出去？这墙上......怎么会有一个洞？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "是我干的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "她的源石技艺误导了你？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "不是源石技艺，是某项技术。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "她改变了附近一定区域内的空气成分构成，干扰了我和我的源石技艺造物的联系，导致我的最后一击偏离了方向。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "这项技术......我之前从未见过。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "缪尔赛思......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mechanist",
              "text": "缪尔赛思的失踪很有可能与她有关。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "她会不会也能切断施术者和水分子的联系？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mechanist",
              "text": "说不定。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mechanist",
              "text": "我也想过，定向加热空气不是什么高端的技术，不至于能控制住缪尔赛思。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "博士，我建议我们立刻追击。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "不论从她掌握的情报来看，还是从她使用的离奇技术来看——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "这位黎博利女士都极端危险。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "警长，您这是要去哪里？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "我不知道我还需要跟你报备。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "记录显示，您取走了一辆载具的钥匙......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "哦，借用一下你们莱茵的资产。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "你乐意的话，帮我跟那个什么混蛋主任报备下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "......警长。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "还有什么话要说？麻烦快一点，我赶时间。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "玛丽·班纳女士，您从小就在特里蒙北郊的铁驮镇上生活。桑尼·罗马诺是您的邻居兼中学时的同窗好友。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "你调查我？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "四年前，罗马诺被登记为感染者，结束了在律所的实习工作，返回铁驮镇。他的医疗保险费用在六个月后停缴。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "可是直到又过去三个月零十七天后，他的名字才出现在了这支拓荒队的名单上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "中间这段时间，他究竟躲在哪里？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "我怎么知道？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "预防问题发生也是我们防卫科工作的一部分。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "......小子，别以为你背一段资料就能吓到我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "我花了五年时间才爬到这个位置上，你当我不知道怎么跟你们这帮大公司养的虫子打交道？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "咳咳——女士，我从来没有质疑过您的能力。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "那就别逼我把你丢到荒地上喂牙兽。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "......警长，也许您不相信我，可我只是想提醒您。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "您......您偶尔会让我想起我曾经的上司。我很尊敬她，但她被私人情感影响，亲手毁掉了自己的前途。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "我不忍心看到您走上一样的路。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "呵......私人情感？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "就算这玩意儿能救人......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "text": "......也救不了自寻死路的那一个。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "紧急通讯——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "text": "联系斐尔迪南主任。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "......第十七次记录，坐标，九区走廊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "对象位置距离上次记录没有发生变化......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "嗯......基础粒子结构稳定。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "还是没信号，什么消息都发不出去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "（进度不能耽搁，得尽快修改方案......）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "（等通讯一恢复，得让老板收到这些报告。）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "......埃琳娜？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "咳......咳咳咳。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你在这里干什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我......我走两步喘口气。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我明白你对拓荒者心有芥蒂......但我们最好还是待在一起。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "上一次袭击发生在十分钟前，距离这里很近。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "它们再次出现的话，你一个人会很危险。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "好啊，我这就回去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "等等。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "在回去之前，你......你真的没有什么想对我说的话吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我不懂你在说什么。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "拓荒者们的情绪并不稳定。要是再次激怒他们，乔伊丝会有危险。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "所以，我理解你并不想在他们面前说出真相。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "但这里只有我和你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "你是想问实验的事吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "你不是项目成员，除非你向公司提出申请......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "别再用这样的说辞搪塞我了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我知道你跟我隐瞒了很多事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我并不生气。我们是朋友，也是同事。莱茵生命的保密规定一向严格，规则之外，每个人也习惯于隐藏自己的真实想法。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "奥利维亚，我不是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你不是故意的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我知道。我怎么可能不知道？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "公司里的感染者并不多。那时候你刚来，午休的时候你主动跟我打招呼......能量科的同事拉住你，偷偷告诉你我是感染者。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你还是向我走了过来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我才不在意你身上那些石头，谁还没点毛病？说你闲话的人，他们就都完美无缺了吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "就算后来......我也不在意我自己身上的石头！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "是啊，这才是我认识的埃琳娜·乌比卡。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你很清楚，这里的实验出现了问题。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "打从一开始，你就知道那些银色物体是什么。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "它们在威胁我们......和外面所有无辜者的生命。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我认识的埃琳娜，绝对不会坐视这么可怕的事情发生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "是什么让你选择闭口不言？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "是不是斐尔迪南......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "......奥利维亚，这是我的工作。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "就跟海伦，还有无数为莱茵生命工作的研究员一样......我的梦想就在这里。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "你说过，你也曾经感激过帕尔维斯主任和莱茵生命。而我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "......斐尔迪南是我努力的目标。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "他许诺了你什么？帮弗兰克斯主任做完这个实验，就让你单独带项目？还是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "奥利维亚，你和姐姐一样，还当我是眼巴巴等着糖果的小孩子吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我知道你对斐尔迪南......对主任有很多误解，你这几年做的那些针对他的调查已经给他添了不少麻烦......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "算了，我用不着替他解释。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "可是，他原本可以拒绝你和罗德岛介入。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "他也想改变莱茵生命，改变哥伦比亚......而且我相信只要有机会，他真的能做到。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你......这么相信斐尔迪南？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你知不知道莱茵......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "谁在那里......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "是不是那些东西又追上来了？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "是拓荒队的人！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "text": "别过来！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "text": "原来......原来领队说的都是对的，你、你们的确是把我们当成实验用兽......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你可能理解错了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "text": "你还想哄骗我们吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "text": "我......我不会再相信了！你们对我们好，都是假的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "请冷静一些，嗯......你叫迈尔对吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "迈尔先生，你不信任我们的话，桑尼就在旁边，你让他来解释一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "text": "我不想......我不想死在这里......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "text": "这该死的......该死的走廊！根本走不到尽头......就和感染者收治区的高墙一样让我喘不过气。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "text": "放过我吧，让我们离开......求你了，我求你了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "text": "要是你不答应，我、我就杀了她！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "乔伊丝！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "怎么会......怎么会这样？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "不，放开乔伊丝......不要伤害她！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "从地面痕迹来看，她刚走过了这里。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "能分辨她离去的方向吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "前面那条巷子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "继续追。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "等一下。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "还有几个疑点没有厘清。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "博士，你有什么新发现？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "刚才那场战斗，我们赢了吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "我并不计较任意一场战斗的输赢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "......我明白博士的意思。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "那个黎博利赢不了我们，但也不至于输得那么快。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "她至少还能再坚持个三分钟左右。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "又或者，她可以在Mechanist赶来之前撤走。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "她像是故意等Mechanist和我赶到。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她像是故意留下什么信息。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "text": "她想引我们进这条巷子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "那我们还要进去吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "进。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "text": "女士，我们都准备好了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "text": "他们很快就会追上来吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "以塞雷娅的性格，就算猜到了我想引她来这里，她也一定会来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "text": "我还是有点担心......那个，动力甲......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "text": "真的不用经过斐尔迪南先生同意吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "这么说，你想考虑一下我更早的提议？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "text": "您是说把我......不不，我什么都没说。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "这是一场测试。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "我们的雇主会乐于见到结果。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "text": "女士，我听到脚步声了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "通知领航小队，开始行动。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
          "text": "我们呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
          "text": "撤。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
